  <sys:String x:Key="danger.anticheat.title">Anti-Cheat Risk Warning</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="danger.anticheat.message">This gaming tweak (VBS / HPET / MMCSS) can conflict with anti-cheat systems such as Riot Vanguard, Easy Anti-Cheat (EAC), or BattlEye. Possible outcomes include blue screens (BSOD), game crashes, or account bans. Only continue if you accept these risks.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="common.status">Status</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="common.adminRequired">This change requires Administrator privileges. Restart WinCleaner with &quot;Run as administrator&quot;.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="common.rebootRequired">Change saved. Restart your PC for it to take full effect.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="common.comingSoon">Quick tips: 1) Turn on Game Mode before you launch a game. 2) Stop Xbox Game Bar from recording in the background (it can cost FPS). 3) In games, use Fullscreen / Exclusive fullscreen when you can. 4) Set your monitor refresh rate (Hz) to the highest value in Windows. 5) Keep your NVIDIA/AMD drivers updated. Manage V-Sync from each game’s own settings — it does not behave the same in every title.</sys:String>
