  <sys:String x:Key="tel.title">Telemetry &amp; Privacy</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="tel.subtitle">Reduces what Windows tracks and reports to Microsoft. It will not magically boost game FPS; it is mainly for privacy and less background load.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="blo.title">Bloatware</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="blo.subtitle">Preinstalled apps most people never open. Remove what you do not use to free space and simplify startup. If you remove one, you will need to reinstall it from the Store.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="blo.critical">Required by system — removal disabled (so you cannot break Windows by accident)</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="blo.onedrive">Uninstall OneDrive</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="blo.confirm">Selected apps will be permanently removed. WinCleaner cannot magically bring them back — you will need to reinstall from the Store. Continue?</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="blo.onedriveConfirm">Uninstall OneDrive completely? Cloud folder sync will stop. You will need to confirm twice.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="gam.title">Gamer Optimizations</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="gam.subtitle">Settings for FPS, latency, and background noise. Do not expect miracles — a good PC plus these tweaks means cleaner performance.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="gam.tips">Monitor &amp; V-Sync Tips</sys:String>
